Engineering, the list goes on.

00:16:54.829 --> 00:16:59.389
And here’s the incredible thing , by signing
up with my link you aren’t just supporting

00:16:59.389 --> 00:17:00.389
me.

00:17:00.389 --> 00:17:04.650
You are supporting educational creators across
the board, because we all own a percentage

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:05.910
of this platform.

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:09.819
We created it to give us creative freedom,
and we have achieved it.

00:17:09.819 --> 00:17:12.150
Nebula is the lifeblood of our channel.

00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:16.690
As sponsors and ad revenues have dropped off
lately, Nebula is what is ensuring our incredible

00:17:16.690 --> 00:17:21.929
team of writers, animators and editors across
Real Engineering and Real Science, including

00:17:21.929 --> 00:17:27.320
myself, can feel secure in uncertain financial
times, and that’s thanks to you.

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:29.370
Real Engineering started with just me.

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:30.940
I barely knew how to animate.

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:35.760
I just had a dream of recreating the magic
I felt watching nature documentaries on TV

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:38.400
growing up, but for engineering.

00:17:38.400 --> 00:17:43.280
Over the past 6 years I have continually reinvested
revenue to hire the incredible people that

00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:44.700
make this channel possible.

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:49.900
Mike, Dylan, Stephanie, Eli, Kirtan, Lorraine,
Josi, Graham.

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:51.490
This channel is not just me.

00:17:51.490 --> 00:17:55.500
It’s a group of dedicated people that you,
our viewers, employ.

00:17:55.500 --> 00:18:00.450
If you want to see Real Engineering continue
to evolve and increase in production value,

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:02.240
this is how you support that mission.

00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:06.850
2 dollars 50 a month for the annual plan,
and you get all that incredible content to

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:06.860
boot.

